        {
            "title": "2021-09-08 update",
            "date": "2021-09-08 02:16:03",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4020014731790162384",
            "content": "Improve Loading\nAdded Controller options\n- Added Gamepad preset\nBosses revised\n- Fixed: 5 Chapter boss' motion bug\n- Added: 4 Chapter boss' new motion\n- Adjusted: 3 Chapter boss' collision checking of laser attack on phase 2\n- Adjusted: 2, 3, and 5 Chapter bosses' difficulty\nFixed graphic issues\n- Issue that showing a solid line in the background tile in Chapter 2\n- Issue that the background tile disappears when the camera room is switched\nAdded/revised texts\n- Modified English translation\nSupport controllers\n- Supporting DualSense, DualShock 2 & 3\nFixed minor issues\n\n"
        }
